<===> README.md
Escape handling like dart-sass (1.106): invalid code points are normalized to
U+FFFD (except for the identifier \0), escaped first letters of keywords and
url(), private use characters and attribute values with backslashes.
<===>
================================================================================
<===> an_plus_b/input.scss
:nth-child(\6f dd) {a: b}
:nth-child(\45 VEN) {c: d}
<===> an_plus_b/output.css
:nth-child(odd) {
  a: b;
}

:nth-child(even) {
  c: d;
}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> attribute/input.scss
[a="\\b"] {c: d}
[e="\66"] {g: h}
<===> attribute/output.css
[a="\\b"] {
  c: d;
}

[e=f] {
  g: h;
}
